      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS... are delighted to present this wonderful three bedroom semi-detached property to the open market spanning approx. 100 sq mtrs / 1,076 sq ft. No 187 offers its lucky new owners an ideal retreat from the hustle and bustle of city life living on the city's doorstep. This is an extremely attractive property that's superbly positioned in Grace Park Heights.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of a welcoming hall, front living room, sitting room and separate kitchen/dining room with access to the rear garden. Upstairs consists of three double bedrooms and a bathroom with a separate WC. The rear garden is lawned, west facing and bordered by mature hedging with a purpose built shed ideal for a variety of uses. The much anticipated release of this property to the market represents a rare and genuine opportunity to purchase a substantial three bedroom semi-detached family home set in a well established Dublin location.\r\n\r\nGrace Park Heights is ideally positioned just off Grace Park Road, offering unparalleled convenience. The property is surrounded by a wealth of local amenities, including the shops, bars, and restaurants of Drumcondra Village. The location is exceptional for its access to educational and healthcare facilities, with Dublin City University (DCU), St. Patrick's Campus, and Beaumont Hospital all within easy reach. The area is served by an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools. Transport links are a key feature. The area is well-serviced by numerous bus routes to the City Centre and offers easy access to the M1, M50, the Dublin Port Tunnel, and Dublin Airport. For leisure and recreation, residents can enjoy a variety of local sports clubs, including Whitehall Colmcille GAA, St Vincent’s GAA, Home Farm Football Club, Rockfield Tennis Club, and nearby Clontarf Golf Club.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all that this wonderful home has to offer. Viewing by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-8844690"
      },
